{
  "game_title": {
    "zh": "逐星",
    "en": "Chasing the Star"
  },
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "intro_opening",
      "type": "opening_text",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "很久很久以前……",
        "en": "Long, long ago…"
      },
      "note": "黑屏开场文字，会显示"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_narration",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "传说，在世界的最高处，有一颗永不熄灭的星星，世人都想寻找到它。",
        "en": "It is said that at the top of the world burns a star that never goes out. Everyone wants to find it."
      },
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_narration_2",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "小骑士，系紧行囊，你该出发了。",
        "en": "Little knight, tighten your pack. It is time to go."
      },
      "note": "开场第二段"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_hint",
      "type": "operation_hint",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "WASD 移动，空格跳跃。",
        "en": "WASD to move, Space to jump."
      },
      "note": "操作提示，显示"
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_light_line",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "暗夜提灯",
        "en": "Night Lantern"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "路这么黑，带着这盏灯走吧。",
        "en": "The road is dark. Take this lantern with you."
      },
      "note": "NPC：暗夜提灯（勇气）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_courage_get",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "获得能力点：勇气",
        "en": "Ability gained: Courage"
      },
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_courage_desc",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "消耗 1 点星光，跃起约 3 米高。\n——“一跃而起的那一刻，我仿佛能看见星星。”",
        "en": "Spend 1 Star Energy to leap about 3 meters high\n——\"At the moment of the leap, it feels like you can see the stars.\""
      },
      "note": "能力说明"
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_bird_line",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "智慧之鸟",
        "en": "Wise Bird"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "前面没路了？骑士，别担心，世上原本就没有路……",
        "en": "No more road ahead? Don't worry, knight. There never was a road…"
      },
      "note": "NPC：智慧之鸟（智慧）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_wisdom_get",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "获得能力点：智慧",
        "en": "Ability gained: Wisdom"
      },
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_wisdom_desc",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "消耗 1 点星光，点亮半径 11 米内的隐藏方块或道路。\n——“谁说前方没有路？”",
        "en": "Spend 1 Star Energy to reveal hidden blocks within 11 meters. \n——\"Who says there's no way ahead?\""
      },
      "note": "能力说明"
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_sword_line",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "断剑骑士",
        "en": "Broken Sword Knight"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "你是去找星星的？骑士，别想了，我什么也没找到，才折返至此。",
        "en": "You're looking for the star? Don't bother, knight. I found nothing, and turned back."
      },
      "note": "NPC：断剑骑士（耐心）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_patience_get",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "获得能力点：耐心",
        "en": "Ability gained: Patience"
      },
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_patience_desc",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "消耗 1 点星光，让脚下的方块上升 2 米。\n——“我的耐心或许不输于我的勇气。”",
        "en": "Spend 1 Star Energy to raise the block under your feet by 2 meters. \n——\"My patience might not be inferior to my courage.\""
      },
      "note": "能力说明"
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_cloud_line",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "希望祥云",
        "en": "Hope Cloud"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "够不着的地方，不如就自己创造一个落脚点。",
        "en": "If you can't reach it, make your own footing."
      },
      "note": "NPC：希望祥云（希望）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_hope_get",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "获得能力点：希望",
        "en": "Ability gained: Hope"
      },
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ability_hope_desc",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "消耗 2 点星光，在前方生成一块临时平台（存在 10 秒，最后 2 秒闪烁）。\n——“世界上最脆弱最宝贵的东西。”",
        "en": "Spend 2 Star Energy to summon a temporary platform ahead (lasts 10 seconds, blinks for the last 2). \n——\"The most fragile and precious thing in the world.\""
      },
      "note": "能力说明"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_narration",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "旁白",
        "en": "Narrator"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "到了，这里就是世界的最高处。小骑士，前方什么也没有。或许星星只是一个传说，一个你梦中的美丽幻影，又或许……",
        "en": "You've arrived. This is the highest place in the world. Little knight, there is nothing ahead. Perhaps the star was only a legend—a beautiful dream in your sleep. Or perhaps…"
      },
      "note": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_jump_hint",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "再跳一步",
        "en": "One more jump."
      },
      "note": "系统提示"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_question",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "旁白",
        "en": "Narrator"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "你找到那颗永不熄灭的星星了吗？",
        "en": "Did you find the star that never goes out?"
      },
      "note": "星空停留"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_continue",
      "type": "operation_hint",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "点击任意键继续",
        "en": "Press any key to continue."
      },
      "note": "UI提示，显示"
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_loop",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "旁白",
        "en": "Narrator"
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "传说，在世界最高处，有一颗永不熄灭的星星。",
        "en": "It is said that at the top of the world burns a star that never goes out."
      },
      "note": "回到起点，循环"
    },
    {
      "id": "death_fade",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "或许终有一天我会停下脚步……",
        "en": "Maybe one day I will stop…"
      },
      "note": "死亡黑屏"
    },
    {
      "id": "death_return",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "但不会是现在。",
        "en": "But not right now."
      },
      "note": "重生提示"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_resume",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "继续旅途",
        "en": "Continue"
      },
      "note": "ESC 菜单"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skills",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "技能提示",
        "en": "Skills"
      },
      "note": "ESC 菜单"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_menu",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "返回主菜单",
        "en": "Main Menu"
      },
      "note": "ESC 菜单"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_quit",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "退出游戏",
        "en": "Quit Game"
      },
      "note": "ESC 菜单"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_default",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "想要越过难关，技能必不可少。\n注意：技能需要消耗星光。",
        "en": "Skills are essential for overcoming challenges.\nNote: Skills consume star energy."
      },
      "note": "ESC 菜单默认文案"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skill_courage",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "1 勇气",
        "en": "1 Courage"
      },
      "note": "技能名"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skill_wisdom",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "2 智慧",
        "en": "2 Wisdom"
      },
      "note": "技能名"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skill_patience",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "3 耐心",
        "en": "3 Patience"
      },
      "note": "技能名"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skill_hope",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "4 希望",
        "en": "4 Hope"
      },
      "note": "技能名"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skill_shift",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "Shift 冲刺",
        "en": "Shift Dash"
      },
      "note": "技能名"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill_shift_desc",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "按住 Shift 冲刺：奔跑速度提升。\n——“或许这是最后的希望。”",
        "en": "Hold Shift to sprint: you run faster and your leap carries farther.\n——\"Maybe this is the last hope.\""
      },
      "note": "技能说明"
    },
    {
      "id": "esc_skill_R",
      "type": "ui",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "R 重置",
        "en": "R Reset"
      },
      "note": "技能名"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill_R_desc",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "text": {
        "zh": "按 R 重新开始游戏。\n——“前方的路并不好走，对吧。”",
        "en": "Press R to reset the game. \n——\"The road ahead is not easy, is it?\""
      },
      "note": "技能说明"
    },
